[{"id":"perfect-competition-market::price-taker","scope":"economics","groupId":"perfect-competition-market","groupTitle":"完全竞争市场","groupTakeaway":"完全竞争是用于分析市场的理想模型，假设买卖者众多、产品同质、进入退出自由且信息充分。单个参与者没有控制价格的能力，现实中的部分农产品市场只是较接近这一模型。","title":"完全竞争厂商为何接受价格","content":"完全竞争模型中买者和卖者众多，单个厂商相对于市场规模很小，不能控制市场价格，只能接受既定价格。因此，价格接受者并不是没有经营自主权，而是缺乏左右市场价格的能力。","label":"完全竞争厂商为何接受价格","note":"完全竞争模型中买者和卖者众多，单个厂商相对于市场规模很小，不能控制市场价格，只能接受既定价格。因此，价格接受者并不是没有经营自主权，而是缺乏左右市场价格的能力。","learningGoal":"说明价格接受者的含义。","productionMode":"light-edit","productionLabel":"轻度整理","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"perfect-competition-market","tabId":"perfect-competition-conditions","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p11-perfect-competition-conditions-list"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=perfect-competition-market&tabId=perfect-competition-conditions","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"stage-level-sampling-deferred","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"c6b04eed","learningSignature":"4f8cbcbc"},{"id":"perfect-competition-market::perfect-assumptions","scope":"economics","groupId":"perfect-competition-market","groupTitle":"完全竞争市场","groupTakeaway":"完全竞争是用于分析市场的理想模型，假设买卖者众多、产品同质、进入退出自由且信息充分。单个参与者没有控制价格的能力，现实中的部分农产品市场只是较接近这一模型。","title":"完全竞争的基本假设","content":"完全竞争假设厂商提供同质产品、买卖双方信息充分、资源流动以及厂商进入退出自由。这些条件共同构成理想分析模型，不能因为某市场厂商多，就认定它满足完全竞争的全部条件。","label":"完全竞争的基本假设","note":"完全竞争假设厂商提供同质产品、买卖双方信息充分、资源流动以及厂商进入退出自由。这些条件共同构成理想分析模型，不能因为某市场厂商多，就认定它满足完全竞争的全部条件。","learningGoal":"说明完全竞争的基本假设的含义。","productionMode":"light-edit","productionLabel":"轻度整理","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"perfect-competition-market","tabId":"perfect-competition-conditions","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p11-perfect-competition-conditions-list"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=perfect-competition-market&tabId=perfect-competition-conditions","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"stage-level-sampling-deferred","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"8465f00e","learningSignature":"81bafde4"},{"id":"monopolistic-competition-market::differentiation","scope":"economics","groupId":"monopolistic-competition-market","groupTitle":"垄断竞争市场","groupTakeaway":"垄断竞争市场的厂商较多，产品存在差别但可相互替代，进入退出相对容易。产品差别带来一定定价空间，替代关系又带来竞争压力，价格竞争与非价格竞争可以同时存在。","title":"垄断竞争：有差别的替代品","content":"垄断竞争市场中厂商较多，生产有差别但可互相替代的同类产品，进入退出相对容易。差别使厂商具有一定定价空间，替代关系又使其面临竞争，因此垄断因素与竞争因素并存。","label":"垄断竞争：有差别的替代品","note":"垄断竞争市场中厂商较多，生产有差别但可互相替代的同类产品，进入退出相对容易。差别使厂商具有一定定价空间，替代关系又使其面临竞争，因此垄断因素与竞争因素并存。","learningGoal":"说明垄断竞争中差别与替代的作用。","productionMode":"light-edit","productionLabel":"轻度整理","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"monopolistic-competition-market","tabId":"monopolistic-conditions","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p11-monopolistic-competition-conditions-list"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=monopolistic-competition-market&tabId=monopolistic-conditions","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"stage-level-sampling-deferred","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"33629954","learningSignature":"12eec796"},{"id":"monopolistic-competition-market::non-price-competition","scope":"economics","groupId":"monopolistic-competition-market","groupTitle":"垄断竞争市场","groupTakeaway":"垄断竞争市场的厂商较多，产品存在差别但可相互替代，进入退出相对容易。产品差别带来一定定价空间，替代关系又带来竞争压力，价格竞争与非价格竞争可以同时存在。","title":"什么是非价格竞争","content":"非价格竞争是通过价格以外的方式争取顾客，例如改进品质、设计包装、改善售后服务和广告宣传。它与降价促销等价格竞争不同，垄断竞争市场中的厂商可以采用这两类手段。","label":"什么是非价格竞争","note":"非价格竞争是通过价格以外的方式争取顾客，例如改进品质、设计包装、改善售后服务和广告宣传。它与降价促销等价格竞争不同，垄断竞争市场中的厂商可以采用这两类手段。","learningGoal":"说明什么是非价格竞争的含义。","productionMode":"light-edit","productionLabel":"轻度整理","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"monopolistic-competition-market","tabId":"monopolistic-methods","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p11-p12-monopolistic-competition-methods-list"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=monopolistic-competition-market&tabId=monopolistic-methods","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"stage-level-sampling-deferred","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"1a38471","learningSignature":"fda632d2"},{"id":"oligopoly-market::few-major-firms","scope":"economics","groupId":"oligopoly-market","groupTitle":"寡头垄断市场","groupTakeaway":"寡头市场的主要生产销售集中于少数厂商，新进入较困难，厂商相互依存。产品可能同质，也可能有差别；价格竞争与联合定价的性质不同，不能把后者当作前者的定义。","title":"寡头垄断的含义","content":"寡头垄断市场是指少数几家厂商控制整个市场的产品生产和销售的一种市场组织。少数厂商占据主要市场地位，是识别这种结构的关键，并不是指行业中只能有一个厂商。","label":"寡头垄断的含义","note":"寡头垄断市场是指少数几家厂商控制整个市场的产品生产和销售的一种市场组织。少数厂商占据主要市场地位，是识别这种结构的关键，并不是指行业中只能有一个厂商。","learningGoal":"区分寡头垄断与单一厂商垄断。","productionMode":"light-edit","productionLabel":"轻度整理","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"oligopoly-market","tabId":"oligopoly-meaning","sourceUnitIds":["cs-23-30-p12-oligopoly-meaning-list"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=oligopoly-market&tabId=oligopoly-meaning","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"stage-level-sampling-deferred","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"f95b8f6d","learningSignature":"68b4137d"}]